格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Deepseek Harness插件，可以直接在Deepseek Harness中使用网页版deepseek进行聊天，并将聊天过程直接迁移到Deepseek Harness进一步进行开发。主要目的是节省前期方案讨论时的token","id":"gh:1340333638","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-web-chat","slug":"xmuwenxiang/dsh-web-chat","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Deepseek Harness插件，可以直接在Deepseek Harness中使用网页版deepseek进行聊天，并将聊天过程直接迁移到Deepseek Harness进一步进行开发。主要目的是节"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ss插件，可以直接在Deepseek Harness中使用网页版deepseek进行聊天，并将聊天过程直接迁移到Deepseek Harness进一步进行开发。主要目的是节省前期方案讨论时的token"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-webchat"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A \"Codex ChatGPT mode\" plugin for DeepSeek Harness: drive chat.deepseek.com with a real browser, cha"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"t with `deepseek-chat` (and `deepseek-reasoner`) using your DeepSeek **web session** — no API billin"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"g. Transfer a conversation into a harness session as development context (distilled into an executab"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"le task brief), import stored web conversations as markdown context, or let the harness agent keep c"},{"id":"p3s5","text":"hatting through the same web session."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"- **Web chat** over your DeepSeek web login, with streaming replies and \"Deep Think (R1)\" / \"Web Sea"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"rch\" toggles.\n- **Transfer to Harness**: distill the current conversation into a task brief and open"},{"id":"p5s3","text":" it as a new harness session to continue development, or \"continue into\" an existing session (append"},{"id":"p5s4","text":" the brief as a new message); pick a target workspace (or leave it ungrouped).\n- **Recover web conve"},{"id":"p5s5","text":"rsations**: pull web-side conversations not yet stored locally into the local store (panel \"Recover "},{"id":"p5s6","text":"from web\" / `webchat_recover`).\n- **Import as context**: export a stored web conversation to markdow"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"n.\n- **Agent tools**: `webchat_status`, `webchat_send`, `webchat_recover`, `webchat_import`, `webcha"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"t_transfer` — the harness agent can chat via the web, inspect transcripts, list workspaces and web c"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"onversations, and transfer a conversation into a new or existing session (optionally into a target w"},{"id":"p5s10","text":"orkspace).\n- **Hands-free login**: first use opens a visible browser window for login, which auto-cl"},{"id":"p5s11","text":"oses afterward; chat then runs headless."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### From npm (once published)"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### From GitHub"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"> `lib/` is committed, so git installs need no build step."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## First use"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"1. Open the \"网页聊天\" (Web Chat) sidebar entry in the Web GUI.\n2. Click \"打开登录窗口\" and sign in to DeepSee"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"k in the browser window that appears.\n3. The window auto-closes after login; you can then chat and t"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"window that appears.\n3. The window auto-closes after login; you can then chat and transfer normally."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Config"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"Settings expose: `browserChannel` (default `auto`), `browserExecutablePath`, `browserProxy`, `browse"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"rHeadless` (chat headless; default `true` — the login window is always visible and auto-closes), `re"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"plyTimeoutMs`, `transferDistill` / `transferProvider` / `transferModel` (distillation model for tran"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"sfer), `transferMaxTokens` (final brief cap, default 4096), and `transferChunkTokens` (per-chunk cap"},{"id":"p15s5","text":" for long-conversation map-reduce, default 1024)."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"- Node.js >= 22\n- Google Chrome or Microsoft Edge installed\n- A graphical session for the one-time l"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"= 22\n- Google Chrome or Microsoft Edge installed\n- A graphical session for the one-time login window"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### dsh (host) compatibility"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"The host half adapts to the settings-section API of the running dsh, and the\npublished `lib/` never "},{"id":"p19s2","text":"statically imports names that newer dsh versions removed —\nso module linking succeeds on every suppo"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"ts names that newer dsh versions removed —\nso module linking succeeds on every supported generation:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"- **dsh ≥ 0.1.2-rc.1** — settings registration moved to\n`SettingsProvider.installSection` (the rc.7-"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"era standalone\n`installSettingsSection`/`settingsNamespace` exports were removed); supported.\n- **ds"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"h 0.1.0-rc.7 / rc.8** — legacy `installSettingsSection` API; supported via\na runtime fallback, so no"},{"id":"p20s4","text":" behavior change on older hosts."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"`dsh.client.inject` lists only client packages that exist on all supported\ngenerations (`@deepseek-a"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"i/dsh-client-runtime` no longer ships at 0.1.2-rc.1 and\nis therefore not referenced). The browser ha"},{"id":"p21s3","text":"lf reads `sessions`/`workspaces` off\nthe client context, whose provider package changed across gener"},{"id":"p21s4","text":"ations — if the\nGUI of a given dsh version does not mount those services, the panel simply does\nnot "},{"id":"p21s5","text":"attach (an error is logged) while host-side tools and routes keep working;\nit never takes the GUI do"},{"id":"p21s6","text":"ach (an error is logged) while host-side tools and routes keep working;\nit never takes the GUI down."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Limitations"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"- The web app is subject to DeepSeek's own risk controls; failures or page changes return errors rat"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"her than crashing.\n- Session credentials live in a local private profile directory."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"`lib/` is committed, so git installs need no build step."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Apache-2.0"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
